cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Lessons in AI from an Image Classifier"
abstract: >-
  A Streamlit lab that walks through how an image classifier learns, from
  pixels and loss to evaluation and the hardware that runs the arithmetic.
  Upload two or more labeled image sets, or use the built-in shapes, and
  train a ResNet-18 from ImageNet weights or from scratch.
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-19
license: MIT
